  "body": "Hi all,\r\nLongtime OWASP reader here. I'm glad to see y'all on GitHub; it makes contribution much easier.\r\n\r\nI noticed #724. I propose we introduce a CI check that validates all links in the document are valid. Automating the check would remove the need for manual QA and hotfixing. \r\n\r\n## proposal\r\n\r\nI propose we add a GitHub Workflow to check for valid links.\r\nYou can see a working example in the following project: https://github.com/exercism/v3/blob/master/.github/workflows/valid-links.yml",
